    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430460/extras/ccc363009c727dd19fe0a21ea6ecbfc0.avif?t=1739646395\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span>a survival game, you play as a skilled female assassin on a perilous quest to find two legendary artifacts: the Golden Relic, a powerful treasure, and the Immortal Key, a mythical object that grants eternal life. After a failed assassination attempt on the King, he flees the kingdom, plunging the land into chaos and sparking a dangerous race to claim the relics. As a player, you must navigate this hostile world, interacting with NPCs to gather crucial information, trade for powerful items, and secure resources that will aid in your mission. The world is vast and filled with dangerous creatures, rival assassins, and traps, all seeking the Golden Relic in the King\u2019s Castle or the Immortal Key in the Temple of the Priestess. Whether you choose to approach combat with stealth or action, you\u2019ll have to be strategic. The world is unforgiving, and your survival depends on your ability to collect potions, and other valuable items from NPCs .As you progress, the challenges become more intense, with other assassins and mythical creatures trying to outsmart, outmaneuver, and eliminate you. Every choice you make will impact your journey as you fight not only for the relics but also for your survival.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430460/extras/ccc363009c727dd19fe0a21ea6ecbfc0.avif?t=1739646395\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span>a survival game, you play as a skilled female assassin on a perilous quest to find two legendary artifacts: the Golden Relic, a powerful treasure, and the Immortal Key, a mythical object that grants eternal life. After a failed assassination attempt on the King, he flees the kingdom, plunging the land into chaos and sparking a dangerous race to claim the relics. As a player, you must navigate this hostile world, interacting with NPCs to gather crucial information, trade for powerful items, and secure resources that will aid in your mission. The world is vast and filled with dangerous creatures, rival assassins, and traps, all seeking the Golden Relic in the King\u2019s Castle or the Immortal Key in the Temple of the Priestess. Whether you choose to approach combat with stealth or action, you\u2019ll have to be strategic. The world is unforgiving, and your survival depends on your ability to collect potions, and other valuable items from NPCs .As you progress, the challenges become more intense, with other assassins and mythical creatures trying to outsmart, outmaneuver, and eliminate you. Every choice you make will impact your journey as you fight not only for the relics but also for your survival.  </p>",
